WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:09.500
Open ONE GO and sign in with your email and password. You stay signed in after that.

2
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:17.600
This is Home. Across the top: today's points, this week's bonus points, the two together, and your streak.

3
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:25.100
Morning Pulse reads your business overnight and tells you what is waiting, and where to start.

4
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.300
Ask Pulse anything about your business.

5
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.900
Pulse answers from your own contacts, tasks and calendar.

6
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:53.700
Under Go To, every screen sits in a circle. A number means something inside is waiting.

7
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:02.200
Tap a circle and its screens open around it, one tap away.

8
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.600
Tasks is today's list. Never more than fifteen, and your VIP-50 touches always come first.

9
00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:18.100
The rings show what is overdue, what is left today, this week, and what is done.

10
00:01:21.100 --> 00:01:26.000
Filter by kind: calls, video texts, notes or face to face.

11
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.500
To do a touch, tap the task.

12
00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:41.900
Pulse tells you why it is due. Call, Text or Video text opens your own phone. Nothing is ever sent for you.

13
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:46.300
When you have made the call, tap Done.

14
00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:59.400
The task comes off the list, and the done ring counts up. You can also move a task to tomorrow, or pick another day.

15
00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:10.800
The Daily Tracker is your scorecard for the day. Sarah has 19 points so far. Each orb holds a group of boxes.

16
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:23.000
Tap a group and its boxes open. When Sarah marked her call to Sarah Mitchell done, her fourth call ticked itself.

17
00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:31.900
She ticks the fifth by hand, and her points go up right away.

18
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:38.200
Pulse suggests what to do next. Your points count toward this week's 100 minimum.

19
00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:47.100
And your last 30 days show your streak, your average, and your great days.

20
00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:55.900
Bonus Points are the weekly boxes: mixer and newsletter, drop-bys, face to face, business and growth.

21
00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:04.100
Sarah sent her mixer invite this week, so she ticks it.

22
00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:11.600
Five more bonus points, and her weekly score goes up.

23
00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:18.600
Your daily points plus your bonus points make your weekly score. The minimum standard is 100.

24
00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:28.500
My Week sets your working hours and your best time for calls. Pulse builds your day inside them, ready by seven every morning.

25
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:37.200
Add standing blocks, like the gym or school pickup, and Pulse keeps them free.

26
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:45.600
Commitments sit on Home. Set up to five every Monday, and check in on Friday.

27
00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:53.100
Some count themselves as you work, like calls made. Tick the rest when they are done.

28
00:03:55.700 --> 00:04:00.300
Every-day commitments sit underneath, ticked one day at a time.

29
00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:08.700
The Calendar shows your whole day: the blocks Pulse planned, and everything you already booked.

30
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:18.400
Tap Looks good to keep the plan. Anything you miss moves to a later time by itself.

31
00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:27.900
Switch to Week to see the days ahead.

32
00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:33.900
Or Month, for the whole picture.

33
00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:43.800
Contacts holds your VIP-50 in the inner ring, and your VIP-100 around them. The colours show this month's touches.

34
00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:58.400
Tap anyone to open their card: how many of this month's five touches are done, and buttons to call, text, email, or let Pulse draft a message.

35
00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.800
Their family: spouse, kids, birthdays, even the dog.

36
00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:21.500
And Tell Us About You: her favourite restaurant, her morning drink, her dream vacation, and how you can serve her.

37
00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:32.800
Hot, Warm and Cold holds every piece of business coming. Hot closes within three months, warm within a year, cold after that.

38
00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:40.200
Tap a class and its people gather round it.

39
00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:50.600
Tap a person for their card: a Pulse reminder, call or text, notes, and their life details.

40
00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:57.500
The Business Rolodex keeps the businesses you trust, grouped by kind.

41
00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:08.300
Tap a group to see the businesses in it, with who to call and why you trust them.

42
00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:14.600
The Referral Network sends clients between ONE agents, with the fee agreed up front.

43
00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:22.900
Here Jenna sent Sarah a buyer moving to Lehi. Tap Accept, and the client lands in Sarah's contacts.

44
00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:31.300
Every referral shows where it stands: working with the client, under contract, or closed.

45
00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:38.400
And the ones Sarah sent out are tracked the same way.

46
00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:46.300
Buyer Needs is a board of what buyers want. Your own needs show how many listings already fit.

47
00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:56.000
Other agents' needs show here too, never the buyer's details. Have a listing that fits? Tap Message.

48
00:06:57.900 --> 00:07:04.900
The Drop-By Map pins every VIP-50 at home, so your quarterly drop-bys are easy to plan.

49
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:15.000
Tap a name and the map flies there. Go opens directions, and Log records the drop-by.

50
00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:30.900
Tap Plan Route, pick your stops, then Optimize and Go opens the fastest route in your maps.

51
00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:39.400
Mixer invites go out from your own number, each with the guest's own RSVP link.

52
00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:42.400
Your flyer goes with them.

53
00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:54.400
Tap All to pick every guest, then send to all of them at once from your phone.

54
00:07:54.900 --> 00:08:00.700
Or tap Text beside one guest to send it with the flyer attached.

55
00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:11.500
The 90-Day Challenge is about who you become. Sarah is on day 36 of 90, with today's score out of 100.

56
00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:21.100
Your commitments stay in front of you: who you are becoming, who you are fighting for, and your goal in each arena.

57
00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:26.200
Body, Spirit, Relationships, Business and Legacy.

58
00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:32.800
Your coach leaves a note each week, and your accountability partner checks in with you.

59
00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:41.900
Every day you work the five arenas. Each box is five points, and the boxes add up to your daily score.

60
00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:48.200
Body, Spirit, Relationships, Business and Legacy, every single day.

61
00:08:48.300 --> 00:09:00.500
Your badges and your history show every day of the 90. At the end, you get your certificate, and a letter from the person you were on day one.

62
00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:08.000
The Lounge is your VIP-50 community: the feed, members, and live calls.

63
00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:15.800
Live calls has the links for the Morning Brief and the coaching calls, one tap to join.

64
00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:20.100
The Video Library holds your training, sorted by topic.

65
00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:28.100
Tap a topic to filter. Tap any video to watch it.

66
00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.200
Power Agent, Training, System, Coaching, and more.

67
00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.900
Tap any video and it plays right on your phone.

68
00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:46.100
VIP-50 Assets holds your workbooks, scripts and handouts.

69
00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:56.800
Everything opens in one tap: the accountability contract, the affirmations sheet, mixer ideas and more, ready to print or share.

70
00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:06.100
On a team, Team Leads shows every lead your team sends you, and where it came from.

71
00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:12.400
Call or text right from here, then tap I contacted them. Speed counts.

72
00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:22.400
The lead pool holds leads anyone on the team can claim. The first to tap Claim gets it.

73
00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:29.100
Notifications keep everything in one place: new leads, messages, referrals, coaching calls, badges and reminders.

74
00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:36.300
Unread ones stay marked in red until you open them.

75
00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:45.100
My Profile is one profile for the whole system: your week score, streak, closings and level.

76
00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:54.700
Your goals for the year: closings, referrals and income, counted from your own start date.

77
00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:05.600
Badges are earned, never given. Here are this week's, your level and XP, and your progress on the rest.

78
00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:12.400
Every badge shows exactly what it takes to earn it.

79
00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:17.900
Plan on the desktop. Do it on your phone. That's ONE GO.
